         <item>
          <widget class="QPlainTextEdit" name="help_text_edit">
           <property name="sizePolicy">
            <sizepolicy hsizetype="Preferred" vsizetype="Preferred">
             <horstretch>0</horstretch>
             <verstretch>0</verstretch>
            </sizepolicy>
           </property>
           <property name="minimumSize">
            <size>
             <width>11</width>
             <height>525</height>
            </size>
           </property>
           <property name="maximumSize">
            <size>
             <width>1150</width>
             <height>550</height>
            </size>
           </property>
           <property name="lineWrapMode">
            <enum>QPlainTextEdit::WidgetWidth</enum>
           </property>
           <property name="readOnly">
            <bool>true</bool>
           </property>
           <property name="plainText">
            <string>This interface is designed to control the KneeSpa DRx physical therapy device.

To begin, enter your user PIN in the login screen.

Once you are logged in, you have the ability to assess tolerance to various positions on the 'Setup' page, then begin treatment on the 'Protocols' page.

Within the 'Setup' page, first set the 'leg length' and 'horizontal' actuators to a comfortable position. From there, you can assess for maximum axial and lateral tolerance.

Within the 'Protocols' tab, you can implmenent various treatments involving decompression at various angles. Enter the patient's maximum tolerance to axial decompression, left lateral movement, and right lateral movement.  Optionally, you may use the 'pulse' feature to allow for subtle pulsation at the protocol's end range of motion or throughout the protocol. Finally, enter the desired duration of the protocol and click 'start.' 

The protocol may be stopped at any time using the 'Stop' button as well as the attached emergency stop. You can see the time to protocol completion useing the timer checkbox, and see the current level of axial pressure using the pressure checkbox.

While performing a protocol, feel free to watch a video detailing the benefits of the KneeSpa DRx by clicking on the video icon in the bottom left-hand corner.

If you need technical assitance for any reason, click the &quot;Profile&quot; icon in the top right, then click &quot;Request Assitance&quot; in the botttom left. A technincian will reach out shortly to address your issue.</string>
           </property>
           <property name="tabStopWidth">
            <number>200</number>
           </property>
          </widget>
